n=18 gate/source battlefield audit (codex-2026-06-01 S520)
Convention: k=17 moving speeds, threshold=1/18.

Residue action on the n=18 unit skeleton
  Unit points are a/18 for a in {1,5,7,11,13,17}.
  A speed with residue r mod 18 covers such a point iff r*a == 0 mod 18.
  residue= 0 covers_unit_points=6
  residue= 1 covers_unit_points=0
  residue= 2 covers_unit_points=0
  residue= 3 covers_unit_points=0
  residue= 6 covers_unit_points=0
  residue= 9 covers_unit_points=0
  residue=17 covers_unit_points=0
  Therefore: without an 18-multiple, all six unit points remain safe.

